WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:08.950
Create a task with a priority, an assignee, labels and a mention, and follow it on the board.

2
00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:13.110
Tasks live next to approvals, in Approvals & tasks.

3
00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:18.170
For a quick note to yourself, type here and press Enter.

4
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:22.400
For a full task, choose New task.

5
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.920
Give it a clear title.

6
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:36.070
Type @ and a name to mention a colleague: they are told by email and in their inbox.

7
00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:38.910
Set the priority.

8
00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:43.110
Labels help you filter the board later.

9
00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:51.970
Choose who does it. You can pick several people, and add watchers who are kept informed.

10
00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:55.200
Create the task.

11
00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:02.240
The task has its own page: a checklist, files, comments and a timeline of everything that happens.

12
00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:07.910
On the board, drag cards between To do, In progress, Waiting and Done.
